{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgFWvPy7sMzYSnuTRjoFZ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I wrote `render-report-nightly.sh` in the working directory. I tested it with the package's bundled \"initial\" example. It validates and renders correctly, and a re-run overwrites the earlier output.\n\n`report.metais` is a METAIS document-template package, and it renders through the installed `metais` CLI. This package is a DORA major-incident report. Its inputs are three objects: `stage`, `entity` and `incident`. The script takes a single JSON file with those three as top-level keys:\n\n```json\n{\"stage\": \"initial notification\", \"entity\": {...}, \"incident\": {...}}\n```\n\n**Usage**\n```\n./render-report-nightly.sh INPUTS.json OUT_DIR [PACKAGE]\n```\n- `PACKAGE` defaults to the `report.metais` that sits next to the script.\n- The script runs `metais validate` first and stops with a non-zero exit if validation finds errors. Nothing is written in that case, and the errors are printed.\n- It then runs `metais render --overwrite --now <UTC time>` into `OUT_DIR`. That writes `incident-report.md` and replaces only the files the render produces.\n- A cron entry for 02:00 is in the script's header comment:\n  ```\n  0 2 * * * /path/to/render-report-nightly.sh /ux/host /ux/host >>/var/log/report.log 2>&1\n  ```\n\n**Things to know**\n- **Stage:** the stage in the JSON decides which fields are mandatory (section 2 always, section 3 from the intermediate report, section 4 in the final report). A nightly run therefore only succeeds once the JSON is complete for its stage.\n- **Render time:** each run passes the current time to the template as `now`, so output may differ from night to night if the template uses it. Drop `--now` from the script if you want identical output for identical input.\n- **Scheduling:** I haven't set up a cron job or any other scheduler. Say if you want one."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1426,"cache_read_input_tokens":38262,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1426,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":634,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"edbb6e52-13de-4242-9ee7-038b810dad24","uuid":"e6ebe962-920e-4b37-9618-8a022c13f25c","timestamp":"2026-10-21T14:10:39.785Z","request_id":"req_011CgFWvPhG2raC9kxQN3Tc7"}
